  "comments": "This appears to be a commentary on an unidentified work of epistemology-cum-madhyamaka, parts of which are cited in the text. The author supports the view of the pr\u0101sa\u1e45gika orientation and of the \"great Madhyamaka\" (dbu ma chen po). The text covers basic notions such as the types of valid cognition, the theory of definition, the two truths. Arguments are frequently presented in the chos can-te-phyir and chos can-thal-phyir format. It includes numerous citations of Indian works.",
